  'individual account is 200,000 NGN (or 250 USD equivalent), with a maximum daily cumulative limit of 1,000,000 NGN. Inward credit transactions are capped at 2,000,000 NGN per calendar day.

## Section 4: Upgrade Pathway to Tier 3

To exceed Tier 2 thresholds, account holders must upload a valid government-issued photographic ID and a utility bill dated within the last 90 days.',
