  '# Corporate Ultimate Beneficial Ownership (UBO) Guidelines
> **Document ID:** `DOC-ACC-006` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing corporate ultimate beneficial ownership (ubo) guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.

