  'Identity Card (NIN slip with verifiable QR), or Driver''s License for all directors holding over 25% equity, alongside the CAC Certificate of Incorporation. In addition, certified Memorandum and Articles of Association (MEMART) and a corporate tax identification number (TIN) must be submitted.

## Section 2.2: Sanctions and PEP Screening

All beneficial owners undergo automated checks against OFAC, PEP, and international sanctions registries before account clearance.',
