  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-012 | TITLE: Mobile Device Fingerprinting & Risk Scoring | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-02-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing mobile device fingerprinting & risk scoring across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
