  '# Corporate Tax Identification Verification Procedures
> **Document ID:** `DOC-ACC-017` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing corporate tax identification verification procedures across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational',
