  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-018 | TITLE: BVN Matching and Name Mismatch Tolerance | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing bvn matching and name mismatch tolerance across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.',
