  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-022 | TITLE: Customer Risk Rating Algorithm and Periodic Review | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-01-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer risk rating algorithm and periodic review across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.',
