  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-024 | TITLE: High-Risk Jurisdiction Account Restrictions | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

