  '# Merchant Sub-Account Provisioning & Hierarchy
> **Document ID:** `DOC-ACC-025` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-04-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing merchant sub-account provisioning & hierarchy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

