  'Virtual Card Creation Limits per Organization
Document ID: DOC-ACC-026 | Version: 1.0 | Status: ACTIVE
Department: Accounts & KYC | Effective Date: 2025-05-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing virtual card creation limits per organization across all ApexPay corporate operations and
regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.
