Department: Accounts & KYC | Effective Date: 2025-06-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing developer sandbox identity simulation rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and
regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.
