  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-027 | TITLE: Developer Sandbox Identity Simulation Rules | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing developer sandbox identity simulation rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
