  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-ACC-029 | TITLE: KYC Audit Logging Requirements | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing kyc audit logging requirements across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Accounts & KYC audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
