  '# Probation Period Evaluation and Confirmation Criteria
> **Document ID:** `DOC-HR-002` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-03-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing probation period evaluation and confirmation criteria across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.

