  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-004 | TITLE: Internal Career Progression and Engineering Promotion Ladders | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-05-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing internal career progression and engineering promotion ladders across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
