  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-007 | TITLE: Paternity and Non-Primary Caregiver Leave Policy | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing paternity and non-primary caregiver leave policy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
