  '# Study Leave, Professional Development and Learning Stipends
> **Document ID:** `DOC-HR-008` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-09-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing study leave, professional development and learning stipends across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.

