  '# Relocation Allowance and Cross-Office Transfer Guidelines
> **Document ID:** `DOC-HR-010` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-11-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing relocation allowance and cross-office transfer guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.

