  '# Annual Performance Bonus and Discretionary Awards Policy
> **Document ID:** `DOC-HR-014` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-04-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing annual performance bonus and discretionary awards policy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.

