  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-016 | TITLE: Notice Periods and Resignation Acceptance Workflows | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing notice periods and resignation acceptance workflows across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
