  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-019 | TITLE: Employee Travel Expense Reimbursement Schedules | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-09-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing employee travel expense reimbursement schedules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
