  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-020 | TITLE: Overtime Compensation and Weekend Support Shift Allowances | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-10-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing overtime compensation and weekend support shift allowances across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
