  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-023 | TITLE: Company Holiday Calendar and Regional Hub Observances | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing company holiday calendar and regional hub observances across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
