  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-HR-025 | TITLE: Employee Onboarding Experience and Provisioning Checklist | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-04-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing employee onboarding experience and provisioning checklist across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the People Operations audit committee.',
