  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-003 | TITLE: API Deprecation Policy and Migration Notice Windows | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-04-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing api deprecation policy and migration notice windows across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
