  '# Capacity Planning and Horizontal Auto-Scaling Thresholds
> **Document ID:** `DOC-OPS-006` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing capacity planning and horizontal auto-scaling thresholds across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.

