  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-008 | TITLE: Cache Invalidation Strategies and Redis TTL Guidelines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-09-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing cache invalidation strategies and redis ttl guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
