  '# System Alerting Thresholds and On-Call Pager Escalations
> **Document ID:** `DOC-OPS-010` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-11-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing system alerting thresholds and on-call pager escalations across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.

