  '# SDK Release Management and Semantic Versioning Protocol
> **Document ID:** `DOC-OPS-011` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-01-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing sdk release management and semantic versioning protocol across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.

