  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-011 | TITLE: SDK Release Management and Semantic Versioning Protocol | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-01-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

