  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-013 | TITLE: Product Analytics Privacy and Telemetry Anonymization | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing product analytics privacy and telemetry anonymization across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
