  '# Customer Communication for Scheduled Downtime
> **Document ID:** `DOC-OPS-019` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-09-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer communication for scheduled downtime across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational personnel',
