  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-020 | TITLE: Operational Runbook Creation and Review Cadence | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-10-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing operational runbook creation and review cadence across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
