  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-021 | TITLE: Third-Party API Dependency Monitoring and Fallback Rules | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-11-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing third-party api dependency monitoring and fallback rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
