  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-OPS-025 | TITLE: Production Change Management Board Guidelines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-04-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing production change management board guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Product Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
  85,
