  '# NIP Instant Settlement Rail Technical Interface
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-001` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-02-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing nip instant settlement rail technical interface across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational',
