  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-005 | TITLE: Interchange Fee Calculation and Pass-Through Pricing | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing interchange fee calculation and pass-through pricing across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.',
