  '# Merchant Rolling Reserve Retention and Release
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-006` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing merchant rolling reserve retention and release across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational',
