  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-007 | TITLE: Foreign Exchange Rate Calculation and Daily Spread Policy | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing foreign exchange rate calculation and daily spread policy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.',
