  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-009 | TITLE: Disbursement Failure Handling and Reversal Times | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-10-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing disbursement failure handling and reversal times across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
