  '# Virtual Account Collection and Real-Time Credit Notification
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-011` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-01-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing virtual account collection and real-time credit notification across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
