  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-013 | TITLE: Corporate Cross-Border FX Wire Execution Guidelines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing corporate cross-border fx wire execution guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
