  'tographically signed before 1:30 PM WAT on business days for guaranteed same-day processing. Batches approved after 1:30 PM WAT will be processed at 07:00 AM WAT on the subsequent business morning.

## Section 3.2: Disbursement File Validation

Batches must strictly adhere to the ApexPay CSV/JSON schema and contain valid beneficiary account numbers, bank sort codes, and narration references.',
