  '# Card Tokenization and PCI Vault Security Standards
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-016` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-06-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing card tokenization and pci vault security standards across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
