  '# 3D Secure (3DS2) Authentication Routing Rules
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-017` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing 3d secure (3ds2) authentication routing rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational',
