  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-018 | TITLE: Merchant Payout Reversal and Negative Balance Recovery | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing merchant payout reversal and negative balance recovery across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
