  '# Recurring Subscription Billing Schedules and Grace Periods
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-021` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-11-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing recurring subscription billing schedules and grace periods across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
