  '# Split Payments and Multi-Vendor Marketplace Settlement
> **Document ID:** `DOC-PAY-023` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-02-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing split payments and multi-vendor marketplace settlement across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments & Settlements audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
