  'End-of-Day Reconciliation and Ledger Settlement Balances
Document ID: DOC-PAY-026 | Version: 1.0 | Status: ACTIVE
Department: Payments & Settlements | Effective Date: 2025-05-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing end-of-day reconciliation and ledger settlement balances across all ApexPay corporate
operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments &
Settlements audit committee.
