  'International Merchant Cross-Border Settlement Timelines
Document ID: DOC-PAY-027 | Version: 1.0 | Status: ACTIVE
Department: Payments & Settlements | Effective Date: 2025-06-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing international merchant cross-border settlement timelines across all ApexPay corporate
operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Payments &
Settlements audit committee.
