  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-027 | TITLE: International Merchant Cross-Border Settlement Timelines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

