  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-PAY-029 | TITLE: Payment Rail Status Page Integration | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

