  'DOC-POL-002',
  'structure_aware',
  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-002 | TITLE: Corporate Information Security Policy and Staff Responsibilities | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing corporate information security policy and staff responsibilities across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
  91,
