  '# Social Media Policy and Public Representation of ApexPay
> **Document ID:** `DOC-POL-003` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-04-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing social media policy and public representation of apexpay across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
