  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-003 | TITLE: Social Media Policy and Public Representation of ApexPay | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-04-15]
[SECTION: Section 3: Record Keeping and Audit Compliance]

