  'eople and their manager, provided it is conducted outside working hours and does not utilize company hardware or IP. Consulting for direct fintech competitors or payment processors is strictly prohibited.

## Section 4: Open Source Contributions

Contributing to open source projects that do not disclose proprietary algorithms is encouraged with standard engineering manager sign-off.',
