  '# Intellectual Property Ownership and Employee Invention Assignment
> **Document ID:** `DOC-POL-007` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-08-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing intellectual property ownership and employee invention assignment across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures',
