  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-008 | TITLE: Document Retention and Legal Hold Procedures | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-09-15]
[SECTION: Section 3: Record Keeping and Audit Compliance]

