  'quivalent). Any gift exceeding $50 USD must be logged in the corporate Gift Register and approved by Compliance. Under no circumstances may cash, gift cards, or negotiable instruments be accepted.

## Section 3: Entertainment and Meals

Occasional business meals within standard commercial moderation are permissible without formal registration if valued under $100 USD per person.',
