  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-011 | TITLE: Vendor Contract Review and Legal Approval Thresholds | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-01-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

