  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-013 | TITLE: Customer Data Privacy and Commercial Use Restrictions | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer data privacy and commercial use restrictions across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
