  '# Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) Sustainability Directives
> **Document ID:** `DOC-POL-014` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-04-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing environmental, social, and governance (esg) sustainability directives across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.

