  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-015 | TITLE: Anti-Money Laundering Internal Staff Reporting Workflow | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-05-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing anti-money laundering internal staff reporting workflow across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
