  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-016 | TITLE: Equal Opportunity Employment and Anti-Harassment Rules | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing equal opportunity employment and anti-harassment rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
