  '# Substance Abuse and Drug-Free Workplace Policy
> **Document ID:** `DOC-POL-017` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-07-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing substance abuse and drug-free workplace policy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational personnel',
