  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-018 | TITLE: Crisis Management Team Activation Protocol | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing crisis management team activation protocol across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
