  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-021 | TITLE: Mobile Phone and Internet Data Subsidy Guidelines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-11-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing mobile phone and internet data subsidy guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
