  'DOC-POL-024',
  'structure_aware',
  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-POL-024 | TITLE: Company Vehicle Use and Driver Safety Standards | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing company vehicle use and driver safety standards across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Legal & Governance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
  91,
