  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-001 | TITLE: Customer Refund Processing Guidelines and Authorizations | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-02-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer refund processing guidelines and authorizations across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
