  '# Pre-Arbitration Settlement Guidelines for Visa/Mastercard
> **Document ID:** `DOC-REF-007` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-08-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing pre-arbitration settlement guidelines for visa/mastercard across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
