  'd0b6596e-dee9-4b40-90a1-89d55ab8acf4',
  'DOC-REF-012',
  'fixed',
  1,
  'fund Windows and Settlement Periods (v2.0)

Under the active 2026 Refund Policy (v2.0, DOC-REF-012), the standard refund period and processing execution window mandates that domestic card refunds are processed within 5 business days, whereas international transfers require up to 14 business days due to intermediary correspondent banking clearing schedules. This defines the authoritative ApexPay refund period and timeline across all corporate systems, strictly superseding all prior timelines or unauthorized override bulletins. Merchants must ensure adequate settlement balances before refund',
  'Chunk 2',
  NULL,
  103,
