  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-013 | TITLE: Merchant Reserve Deductions for Excessive Disputes | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing merchant reserve deductions for excessive disputes across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
