  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-015 | TITLE: Dispute Mediation and Direct Merchant Settlement | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-05-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing dispute mediation and direct merchant settlement across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
