  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-018 | TITLE: Bank Card Scheme Arbitration Filing Deadlines | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing bank card scheme arbitration filing deadlines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
