  '# Customer Fraud Dispute Investigation Checklists
> **Document ID:** `DOC-REF-019` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-09-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer fraud dispute investigation checklists across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational',
