  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-021 | TITLE: Merchant Dispute Notification Email & Webhook SLAs | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-11-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing merchant dispute notification email & webhook slas across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
