  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-REF-023 | TITLE: Settlement Offset for Pending High-Volume Disputes | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-02-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing settlement offset for pending high-volume disputes across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
