Department: Merchant Operations | Effective Date: 2025-05-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing chargeback fraud abuse and serial disputer blacklist across all ApexPay corporate
operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations
audit committee.
