  'Customer Overpayment Reversal Procedure
Document ID: DOC-REF-027 | Version: 1.0 | Status: ACTIVE
Department: Merchant Operations | Effective Date: 2025-06-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing customer overpayment reversal procedure across all ApexPay corporate operations and
regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Merchant Operations audit
committee.
