  '# PCI-DSS Level 1 Compliance Governance Framework
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SEC-001` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-02-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing pci-dss level 1 compliance governance framework across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

