  '3a10b9f0-eccd-44f8-a8f3-5d75fc11b32b',
  'DOC-SEC-002',
  'fixed',
  1,
  'lowercase, numbers, and symbols, and must be rotated every 90 days. Hardware token 2FA is mandatory. Passwords may not reuse the previous 12 historical passwords.

## Section 4: Hardware Token Enforcement

FIDO2-compliant physical YubiKey tokens are mandatory for all production bastion host and VPN logins.',
  'Chunk 2',
  NULL,
  59,
