  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-003 | TITLE: Production Database Encryption at Rest and in Transit | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-04-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing production database encryption at rest and in transit across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
