  '# Zero Trust Network Access (ZTNA) Architecture Guidelines
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SEC-005` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-06-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing zero trust network access (ztna) architecture guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.

