  'DOC-SEC-006',
  'structure_aware',
  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-006 | TITLE: Employee Security Awareness and Phishing Training Standards | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-07-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing employee security awareness and phishing training standards across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
  91,
