  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-007 | TITLE: Security Operations Center (SOC) Alert Triage Procedures | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing security operations center (soc) alert triage procedures across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
