  '# Vendor Security Due Diligence and Third-Party Risk Matrix
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SEC-008` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-09-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing vendor security due diligence and third-party risk matrix across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
