  '660a29db-7b48-4c64-ab77-f43b01b6d214',
  'DOC-SEC-009',
  'fixed',
  1,
  'in 2 hours of initial triage, and regulatory notification must occur within 72 hours under NDPR/GDPR rules. The Security Operations Center operates 24/7 incident response channels.

## Section 3: Regulatory Filings

Formal incident reports to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC) must include the scope of data affected, containment measures, and remediation plans.',
  'Chunk 2',
  NULL,
