  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-010 | TITLE: Customer Data Subject Access Request (DSAR) Protocol | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-11-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer data subject access request (dsar) protocol across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
