  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-012 | TITLE: Data Loss Prevention (DLP) Endpoint Monitoring Policy | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-02-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing data loss prevention (dlp) endpoint monitoring policy across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
