  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-013 | TITLE: Physical Security Protocols for Server Rooms and Offices | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-03-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing physical security protocols for server rooms and offices across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
