  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-017 | TITLE: Bug Bounty Program Guidelines and Disclosure Matrix | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-07-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

