  'f97d90d9-41b2-49bb-9bc0-35c31da4d2ea',
  'DOC-SEC-019',
  'structure_aware',
  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-019 | TITLE: Business Continuity and Disaster Recovery (BCDR) Plans | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-09-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing business continuity and disaster recovery (bcdr) plans across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
