  '4e4cf1bc-eaa9-4293-bf15-c7527c7878f9',
  'DOC-SEC-020',
  'structure_aware',
  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SEC-020 | TITLE: Annual Disaster Recovery Failover Drill Protocol | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-10-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing annual disaster recovery failover drill protocol across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
  NULL,
