  '# Cryptographic Hash Standards for Stored Credentials
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SEC-021` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-11-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing cryptographic hash standards for stored credentials across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security & Compliance audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and',
