  'Security Audit Log Immutability and Retention Periods
Document ID: DOC-SEC-023 | Version: 1.0 | Status: ACTIVE
Department: Security & Compliance | Effective Date: 2025-02-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing security audit log immutability and retention periods across all ApexPay corporate
operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Security &
Compliance audit committee.
