  '8dc142af-a07c-4901-a122-a8160ec30fe4',
  'DOC-SUP-001',
  'fixed',
  1,
  'in-app chat support from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM WAT, Monday through Saturday. Phone support is reserved exclusively for Priority and Enterprise accounts. Urgent tickets logged outside operational hours are queued for first triage at 8:00 AM WAT the following morning.

## Section 1.3: Priority Escalations

Priority retail accounts gain extended chat access until 11:00 PM WAT daily. Dedicated phone support lines are unlisted and provisioned directly within the Enterprise client dashboard.',
  'Chunk 2',
  NULL,
  94,
