  1,
  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SUP-004 | TITLE: Customer Identity Verification on Voice Calls | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-05-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer identity verification on voice calls across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.',
  'Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose',
