  '# Ticketing Categorization & Routing Rules
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SUP-005` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-06-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing ticketing categorization & routing rules across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational personnel must execute',
