  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SUP-007 | TITLE: Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) Survey Benchmarks | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-08-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing customer satisfaction (csat) survey benchmarks across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.',
