  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SUP-008 | TITLE: Technical Incident Communication Protocols | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-09-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

