  '# Fraud Escalation Hotline Workflow
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SUP-011` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-01-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing fraud escalation hotline workflow across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.

## Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements

Operational personnel must execute daily',
