  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SUP-016 | TITLE: Customer Record Update Handling | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-06-15]
[SECTION: Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements]

