  '# Payment Gateway Incident Management Protocol
> **Document ID:** `DOC-SUP-020` | **Version:** 1.0 | **Effective Date:** 2025-10-15 | **Status:** ACTIVE
## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing payment gateway incident management protocol across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.

