## Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing support team shift handover procedures across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.

