Department: Customer Support | Effective Date: 2025-05-15
Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose
This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational
guidelines governing merchant chargeback advisory guidelines across all ApexPay corporate operations and
regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.
Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements
