  'f21e70a8-a84a-4328-8d7a-45286c3ca1b0',
  'DOC-SUP-026',
  'fixed',
  1,
  'port audit committee.
Section 2: Core Procedures and Requirements
Operational personnel must execute daily workflows in adherence with standard protocol. Key performance
indicators are audited weekly. All exceptions to standard handling must be logged with ticket references, verified
by an authorized manager, and reviewed during monthly operational governance audits.
Section 3: Record Keeping and Audit Compliance
All operational records, logs, and approval trails related to this policy must be retained in the central compliance
repository for a minimum period of 3 years. Unauthorized',
  'Chunk 2',
  NULL,
