  '[DOCUMENT: DOC-SUP-028 | TITLE: Cross-Border Support Routing | VERSION: 1.0 | STATUS: ACTIVE | EFFECTIVE: 2025-07-15]
[SECTION: Section 1: Policy Scope and Purpose]

This official operational documentation establishes the mandatory standards, procedural steps, and operational guidelines governing cross-border support routing across all ApexPay corporate operations and regional business units. Compliance with this directive is monitored by the Customer Support audit committee.',
